			"notes": "## Highlights\n\n- Added `/mfb replace <origin> <new> [except]` with single or multiple exclusions.\n- Added radial-menu Place/Break and Selection-only workflows.\n- Selection-only mode keeps incomplete anchors client-side and reports pos1/pos2/pos3 only after completion.\n- Fixed left-click selection cancellation, empty-hand selection, and floor preview rendering.\n- `/mfb cancel` clears pending commands; `/mfb clearpos` clears all selection anchors and preview."
		},
