			"notes": "## Fix re-release — 2026-08-17\n\n- Fixed repeated `65539: Invalid key -1` / `GL ERROR` log spam caused by polling unbound MaxFastBuild key mappings (`GLFW_KEY_UNKNOWN`, `-1`).\n- Applies to both Minecraft 26.2 and 1.21.7 Fabric clients.\n- All v0.1.1 binaries below were rebuilt from the original v0.1.1 release plus this hotfix only.\n\n## Added\n- Arc and array building modes with array spacing controls.\n- Litematica bulk paste with block-entity NBT, entities, instant mode, region metrics, and server-side validation.\n- Server-advertised paste and payload limits with Minecraft 26.2 and 1.21.7 client support.\n- Nearby-container material search, nested shulker handling, seed-farm shortcuts, and audit integrations.\n\n## Changed and Fixed\n- Pasted blocks use the regular protection, tool, economy, and persistence paths.\n- Deferred physics and convergence passes improve bulk placement results.\n- Fixed schematic region block entities, sign text, shulker billing, and pane, fence, coral fan, stair, slab, and slope placement."
		},
