			"notes": "## MaxFastBuild v0.1.0-alpha\n\n### Fixes\n- **CoreProtect triple-logging resolved**: BREAK operations now produce exactly 1 record (audit logRemoval), PLACE produces 1 record (logPlacement), PLACE-over-solid produces 2 records (logRemoval + logPlacement)\n- Permission nodes registered for LuckPerms display; removed unused \\maxfastbuild.break\\\n\n### Features\n- \\/mfb about\\ — shows license (LGPL-3.0-only), copyright, website (max.iruanp.com), and repository link\n- Radial build screen: horizontal primary mode ring layout\n- Build tasks: \\copyReleaseJars\\, \\deployPaperToLeaf\\\n\n### Documentation\n- Architecture, configuration, and protocol docs updated"
		},
