			"notes": "## MaxFastBuild 0.1.0-pre.2\n\n### Fixes\n- **Paper/Leaf 1.21.11 load**: `api-version` is now `1.21` (no more `Unsupported API version 26.2` on 1.21.11)\n- Compiles against `paper-api:1.21.11-R0.1-SNAPSHOT`; still intended to run on newer lines (e.g. 26.2)\n- **SQLite no longer shaded** into the Paper jar (~14 MB → ~130 KB). Provide `sqlite-jdbc` on the server classpath if missing\n- Soft fallbacks for some Paper-only break/damage method signatures\n\n### Artifacts\n- **MaxFastBuild-Paper-0.1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar** — server plugin\n- **MaxFastBuild-Fabric-0.1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar** — Fabric client (26.2 stack)\n\n### Requirements\n- Server: Paper/Leaf **1.21.11+**\n- Java 21+\n- Soft-depend: Vault, CoreProtect"
		},
