			"notes": "## MaxFastBuild 0.1.0-pre.1\n\nFirst public pre-release for Minecraft **26.2** (Java 25).\n\n### Artifacts\n- **MaxFastBuild-Paper-0.1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar** — Paper/Leaf server plugin\n- **MaxFastBuild-Fabric-0.1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar** — Fabric client mod (use with Fabric API)\n\n### Highlights\n- Server-authoritative place/break shapes via compact `/__mfb` protocol\n- Economy (Vault), materials, tool durability, CoreProtect audit\n- Place-over-solid: break validation + durability + optional per-block charge\n- `/mfb` CLI with Chinese help (default), hand-based apply (block=place, tool=break)\n- PlugMan-friendly unload; jars also land in `release/` on `./gradlew build`\n\n### Notes\n- Pre-release: expect bugs; report issues on GitHub\n- Requires CoreProtect when `coreprotect.required: true` (default)"
